The SVG files in this folder are unmodified glyph bodies of the Solar set as distributed in the
npm package @iconify-json/solar@1.2.10 (Iconify's packaging of Solar; its info.json declares
author "480 Design" and license "CC BY 4.0", SPDX CC-BY-4.0). They were resolved with
@iconify/utils getIconData — the same source and resolver the Halal Goes repository uses in
packages/ui-web/scripts/generate-icons.mjs.

The only change made for these asset files: the glyph ink `currentColor` is written as the
fixed hex #232323 (text.primary, light theme), because an SVG shown through <img> cannot
inherit a colour. In code the Icon component keeps `currentColor`.

Attribution required by CC BY 4.0 when these glyphs are redistributed:
  "Solar Icon Set" by 480 Design, licensed under CC BY 4.0
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). No changes were made to the glyph shapes.
